---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 22,
  title: 'Day 22',
  date: '2026-09-26',
  description: 'Lights festival',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Today, I had nothing to do, so I thought, I'll learn programing full
          day, but, somehow, I didn't learn that as I wanted, I miss my monitor,
          so I made my Ipad a second monitor, I also meet my roommate for the
          first time, I think he's a nice man, I ate something, after this I
          meet Wiktor for the first time in real live, we were going to mamu, to
          use auto simulators or something like this, but today is sunday so it
          was closed, luckily, there was a light festival (event one per year),
          so I'm glad I come for this meeting. It was really fun + I know more
          about Wiktor, he's a really interesting man
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        I'll end this next.js course. I must do it. and I'll find another one +
        I'll creat Next page that will contain my knowlage and projects
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        How I rate this day
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'll give 6/10, It was really good day, I could learn useful things
          like programming etc. but I'm happy about how this day looked
        </p>
        <DayRating class="w-full" rating={6} />
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
